---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import { SITE_NAME } from '../lib/site';

const stats = [
  { value: '$50M', label: 'DTC revenue scaled as COO' },
  { value: '$42M', label: 'raised' },
  { value: '500k', label: 'downloads of an AI doctor app' },
  { value: '7 yrs', label: 'as COO, through Chapter 11 to profitability' },
];
---

<Layout title={`About | ${SITE_NAME}`} description="DTC operator turned AI builder. 7 years COO at Wild Earth. YC, INSEAD, Cambridge." canonical="/about/">
  <SiteHeader />
  <main class="container about">
    <header class="intro">
      <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>
      <p class="lede">Most DTC commentary is tactical. Most AI commentary is generic. I&#39;m interested in what happens at the intersection.</p>
    </header>

    <dl class="stats">
      {stats.map((stat) => (
        <div>
          <dt>{stat.label}</dt>
          <dd>{stat.value}</dd>
        </div>
      ))}
    </dl>

    <div class="body">
      <p class="credentials">Cambridge Mathematics<br />INSEAD MBA<br />YC Alum</p>
      <div class="text">
        <p>I spent 7 years as COO scaling a DTC consumer brand &mdash; $50M revenue, $42M raised, led the company through Chapter 11 to profitability. Before that: YC, Bain, INSEAD, and a decade founding things (including an AI doctor app with 500k downloads). Now I&#39;m building AI systems and watching everything I learned about commerce change at the infrastructure level.</p>
        <p>Agentic AI is doing more to DTC than automating workflows. It&#39;s changing who the customer is, how acquisition works, what brand loyalty means, and which business models survive. Most operators aren&#39;t ready for it. Most AI builders don&#39;t understand the commerce layer. I sit in the gap between them.</p>
        <p>Right now: building AI systems and figuring out what to build next in this space. Writing about the shifts most DTC operators are still catching up to.</p>
        <p>If you&#39;re a DTC founder or operator trying to understand what agentic AI actually means for your business &mdash; <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/antonyevans/">I&#39;d like to connect</a>.</p>
        <p class="actions">
          <a class="button" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/antonyevans/">Connect on LinkedIn</a>
          <a class="button button-ghost" href="/blog/">Read the writing</a>
          <a class="button button-ghost" href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter />
</Layout>

<style>
  .about { padding-block: 3rem 0; }

  .intro {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: flex-end;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1.5rem 3rem;
    padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .lede {
    margin: 0;
    flex: 1 1 24rem;
    max-width: 30ch;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 2.8vw, 2.4rem);
    line-height: 1.12;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }

  .stats {
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(13rem, 1fr));
    border-top: 3px solid var(--ink);
  }

  .stats div {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column-reverse;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem 2rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .stats dd {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 4.5rem;
    line-height: 0.9;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
  }

  .stats dt { color: var(--ink-2); }

  .body {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 2rem 4rem;
    margin-top: 3.5rem;
  }

  .credentials {
    flex: 1 1 12rem;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    line-height: 2;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .text {
    flex: 999 1 32rem;
    min-width: 0;
    max-width: 44rem;
    font-size: 1.1875rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .text p:first-child { margin-top: 0; }

  .actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
</style>
